底部有一个圆形徽章，内有数字“20”，表明这是20年陈酿的高端系列。\n\n- **右侧酒瓶**：\n    - 瓶身同样为浅绿色陶瓷，但形状更为圆润。\n    - 标签设计更为繁复华丽，以米白色为底，饰有金色龙纹或祥云图案，并印有“竹叶青酒”字样。\n    - 标签上可见“52%vol”和“净含量:500ml”等产品信息。\n    - 瓶盖为金色圆柱形。\n\n---\n\n### **3. 背景与装饰元素**\n\n整个画面构建在一个充满想象力的中式山水场景中：\n\n- **背景**：远景是淡蓝色的天空和层叠的青绿色山峦，营造出一种"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 13, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [476.39801025390625, 569.3394775390625], "pos": [4452.52392578125, -695.3108520507812], "id": 17, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "1.2.5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [15, 16], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["208f691922d0be0a83d86b0070bf8f5d8490f59898438f724ea9b6bde6e80167.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [270, 314], "pos": [3387.787841796875, -420.0026550292969], "id": 18, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.16.4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [3733.36572265625, -26.11343765258789], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 